  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad6b4272890c70c4eb3d3dfe4810ac24, type: 3}
  m_Name: D_Ignatius_Claim_01
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Morsoul.Dialogue::Morsoul.Dialogue.DialogueData
  id: D_Ignatius_Claim_01
  nodes:
  - id: ignatius_repeat
    speakerName: Master Alchemist Ignatius
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: You again? Stop hovering around my parlor! Unless the City Council has approved my emergency compensation, I have nothing to say to you.
    registersClue: {fileID: 0}
    setsFlag: 
    requiresFlag: Ignatius_ClaimHeard
    options:
    - label: Inquire about the destroyed vault & dark magic
      nextNodeId: ignatius_vault
      requiresFlag: 
    - label: Inquire about crime scene access
      nextNodeId: ignatius_access
      requiresFlag: 
    - label: Conclude the inquiry
      nextNodeId: ignatius_leave
      requiresFlag: 
    nextNodeId: ignatius_greeting
  - id: ignatius_greeting
    speakerName: Master Alchemist Ignatius
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: You dare cross my threshold with mud on your treads, automaton? An entire quarter-century of alchemical mastery reduced to vapor by dark magic, and the Guild insults me with a mechanical scrap-collector?!
    registersClue: {fileID: 0}
    setsFlag: 
    requiresFlag: 
    options: []
    nextNodeId: ignatius_claim
  - id: ignatius_claim
    speakerName: Master Alchemist Ignatius
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: "A rogue infiltrator breached my inner sanctum using volatile dark magic, destroying my entire life\u2019s work! Ten thousand gold ducats worth of inventory, dissolved into thin air! If the City Commercial Treasury does not reimburse me before noon, Asterveil faces ruin!"
    registersClue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d817a027516c7b9429771ad19bc243d5, type: 2}
    setsFlag: Ignatius_ClaimHeard
    requiresFlag: 
    options: []
    nextNodeId: ignatius_menu
  - id: ignatius_menu
    speakerName: Master Alchemist Ignatius
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: Well? What else does the Investigator's Guild want with me?
    registersClue: {fileID: 0}
    setsFlag: 
    requiresFlag: 
    options:
    - label: Inquire about the destroyed vault & dark magic
      nextNodeId: ignatius_vault
      requiresFlag: 
    - label: Inquire about crime scene access
      nextNodeId: ignatius_access
      requiresFlag: 
    - label: Conclude the inquiry
      nextNodeId: ignatius_leave
      requiresFlag: 
    nextNodeId: 
  - id: ignatius_vault
    speakerName: Master Alchemist Ignatius
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: "Two hundred sealed crates of Batch #408 Greater Restoration Draughts! What else could melt through Dwarven cold-iron tumblers without tripping the municipal ward-chimes? Forbidden volatile sorcery! Do not lecture me on alchemy, construct\u2014go apprehend the dark cultists!"
    registersClue: {fileID: 0}
    setsFlag: 
    requiresFlag: 
    options: []
    nextNodeId: ignatius_menu
  - id: ignatius_access
    speakerName: Master Alchemist Ignatius
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: The subterranean vault is sealed under strict quarantine! If you don't have Guildmaster Ovan's signed forensic warrant, you will not set one iron toe down those stairs. And if you DO have his parchment... mind your clunky treads down there! If you shatter a single undamaged alembic, I shall hold the Investigator's Guild personally liable for the damages!
    registersClue: {fileID: 0}
    setsFlag: 
    requiresFlag: 
    options: []
    nextNodeId: ignatius_menu
  - id: ignatius_leave
    speakerName: Master Alchemist Ignatius
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: Hmph. Then go find the culprits and stop obstructing honest commerce!
    registersClue: {fileID: 0}
    setsFlag: 
    requiresFlag: 
    options: []
    nextNodeId: 
  startNodeId: ignatius_repeat
  portraits: []
